    "name": "Norden Ruder Hostel Taichung",
    "detail": "The hostel opened 10 days ago so everything s brand new, incidentally one of the best ones I've been to. It is located right in front of the station on the 12th floor and the view from the common spaces are quite nice. The design is very nice and the facilities very good, only complain would be that there was no locker in my room, which I guess they will add later. As for the room, the mattress and pillow were great, cover was maybe a bit too thick for hot Taiwan, bathroom was shared with one more tenant and impeccable. Didn't use the kitchen much save for some tea and there is always hot water ready to be used.",
